{
  "ledger": [
    "station wagon (cream paint, woodgrain sides, roof rack) | front end oriented frame-left, near side facing camera, positioned on right shoulder of desert road | same orientation and trim layout through end of shot | single continuous take; camera arcs from front-quarter view to side close-up; grille, hood ornament, roof rack, wipers, and chrome mirror stay fixed to the body consistently",
    "desert road & background | two-lane road with yellow center dashes receding to frame-left behind car; shrubs, distant mountains | same road geometry; utility poles along left roadside enter view progressively | background displacement smooth and consistent with car moving forward while camera tracks alongside",
    "woman leaning from front door window | torso behind door panel, crossed arms resting on window sill | identical pose relative to car at end | hair transitions from still to wind-blown (~00:05), matching onset of vehicle motion; no positional jump relative to door/aperture",
    "antenna mast (front fender) | vertical mast, base at fender/cowl junction | same attachment point | apparent base position drifts smoothly relative to hood silhouette, consistent with parallax from camera arc; occlusion by hood edge evolves continuously",
    "occlusion stack | door panel occludes woman's lower body; window sill occludes forearms; woman's body occludes cabin interior and far-side glass; hood occludes antenna base and road behind | unchanged through all frames | no foreground/background inversions; no element visible through a surface that should block it"
  ],
  "findings": []
}
